  caption: {fileID: 1682904801}
  captionBackdrop: {fileID: 540696825}
  captions:
  - Start: 20.5
    End: 28
    Text: "ANTALYA  /  AKDEN\u0130Z KIYISI\nBir k\u0131y\u0131y\u0131 korumak, bir
      ya\u015Fam\u0131 korumakt\u0131r."
  - Start: 33
    End: 39
    Text: "Temiz su, sa\u011Fl\u0131kl\u0131 ekosistemler ve g\xFCvenli g\u0131da
      ayn\u0131 gelece\u011Fe ba\u011Fl\u0131."
  - Start: 39
    End: 50
    Text: "COP31  /  ANTALYA\nG\u0131da g\xFCvenli\u011Fi i\xE7in ortak gelecek."
  - Start: 54
    End: 66
    Text: "COP31 haz\u0131rl\u0131klar\u0131nda g\xF6revli bir \xFCr\xFCn denet\xE7isisin.\nBug\xFCn\xFCn
      kararlar\u0131, yar\u0131n\u0131n sofras\u0131n\u0131 korur."
  - Start: 72
    End: 79
    Text: "G\u0131da \u2022 Su \u2022 \u0130klim\nBirlikte korunan bir gelecek."
  - Start: 80
    End: 88
    Text: "Kayna\u011F\u0131 izle. Riski belirle. \u0130sraf\u0131 azalt.\nAntalya
      G\u0131da G\xFCvenli\u011Fi Tesisi \u2014 ilk vardiya."
  turtles:
  - {fileID: 1213868407}
  - {fileID: 2121259290}
  - {fileID: 1887931561}
  - {fileID: 1891105203}
  - {fileID: 1464818393}
  quoteEnd: 19
  fadeDuration: 1.2
